SUMMARY:28th Annual PA Haiti Benefit Auction
DESCRIPTION:The auction purpose is a cooperative effort of many churches and individuals to procure funds for qualifying missions — enabling them to share God’s love in Haiti. \nChicken Barbecue Supper\, 4:30 pm \nPlus cheese burgers\, pulled pork & sausage sandwiches\, hot dogs\, blooming onions\, French fries\, Acai bowls\, homemade fresh fruit smoothies\, iced coffee\, a large assortment of drinks\, homemade donuts & fry pies\, homemade soft pretzels\, soft-serve ice cream and as well as a lot homemade baked goods will be available throughout the evening.\n* Drive through take-out is available for chicken BBQ. \nAcapella Singing by the Martin Family from Dauphin County\, 6 pm \nAuction\, 7 pm\nFeaturing tools\, crafts\, quilts & other specialty items. Auction to begin in the Main Tent right directly after the Gospel Singing. \nFriday is an excellent time to preview and inspect the items that will be sold during the auction on Saturday. \n\nSaturday\, July 18\, 2026\nBreakfast\, 6:30 am – 9 am. \nPancakes\, sausage\, fried mush\, eggs and home fries. Coffee and orange juice. Delicious homemade donuts and more! \nItems available at the Auction\n(Auction starts at 8 am sharp in large white tent) \n\nNew Furniture\nQuilts\nTools\, Gardening\, Sporting Goods & Hunting Equipment\nLawn Furniture\nGazebos\, sheds\, and swings\nCarriages\, Tractors & Equipment\nHandcrafted Items and much more…
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/28th-annual-pa-haiti-benefit-auction/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Event Field\, 320 North Ronks Road\, Bird-in-Hand\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/PAHaitiAuction.jpg
END:VEVENT
